stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Active : POST /api/shorten (valid URL, no expiry or future expiry)

    Active --> Redirecting : GET /{code} received
    Redirecting --> Active  : click recorded, 302 returned

    Active --> Expired : expires_at datetime passes (checked at redirect time)
    Expired --> [*]    : GET /{code} → 410 Gone (no state change, terminal)

    Active --> Deleted : DELETE /api/urls/{code} OR admin soft-delete
    Deleted --> [*]    : is_active = false, 404 returned for all requests

    note right of Active
        click_count increments on every redirect
        last_accessed updated to UTC now
        referrer updated from HTTP Referer header
    end note

    note right of Expired
        Record remains in DB (is_active = true)
        Only expires_at check prevents redirect
        Stats endpoint still works
    end note

    note right of Deleted
        is_active = false
        Short code becomes available for reuse
        Historical click data retained
    end note
